1. EXECUTIVE OVERVIEW & PURPOSE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ShareIt is a production-grade, zero-install, browser-based communication and 
screen-sharing platform. Users can create or join encrypted meetings instantly 
without account registration, downloads, or plugins.

Core Capabilities:
1. Ultra-fast real-time screen sharing (Full screen, application window, browser tab)
   with audio capture where supported by the browser/OS.
2. Two-way interactive Remote Screen Control:
   - Presenter authorization dialog ("Grant Control" / "Deny").
   - Remote mouse pointer visualization with click ripples and coordinate sync.
   - Collaborative canvas telestrator pen for markup directly over the screen.
   - Remote keypress visualization and presenter emergency revocation ("Esc" key or button).
3. Real-time video and audio calling with device switching (mic, camera, speaker) 
   and front/back camera toggling on mobile.
4. Simultaneous screen and camera sharing with floating webcam picture-in-picture.
5. In-meeting real-time texting chat:
   - Side-by-side docked panel on desktop (does not obscure the video/screen).
   - Touch-friendly sliding sheet on mobile.
   - Heads-up toast notifications with instant inline quick-reply.
6. Direct Peer-to-Peer Chunked File Sharing (16KB binary chunks over WebRTC DataChannel)
   with explicit user Accept/Decline security prompts (never auto-accepts files).
7. Three-Way Dynamic Theme Engine:
   - Dark Theme: Classic Deep Navy (#090d16 / #0f172a) with Azure Blue accents (#0c87eb).
   - Black & White Monochrome Theme: Pure AMOLED Black (#000000), Stark White (#ffffff),
     razor borders (#27272a), high-contrast black text on white buttons.
   - Light Theme: Crisp Clean White (#ffffff) and Soft Canvas (#f8fafc) with dark slate text.
8. Mobile-responsive across Android (Chrome/Firefox) and iOS/iPadOS (Safari).

