6. CLI COMMANDS & WORKFLOW CHEATSHEET
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Development:
  - Install dependencies: `npm install`
  - Start local dev server: `npm run dev`
  - Run Vitest tests: `npm test`
  - Build TypeScript & bundle: `npm run build`

Deployment:
  - Deploy to GitHub Pages: `npm run deploy` (Runs `gh-pages -d dist`)
  - Automated CI/CD: Pushing to `main` triggers `.github/workflows/deploy.yml` which
    builds the project and publishes to the `gh-pages` branch.

PowerShell Syntax Note:
  On Windows PowerShell, do not chain commands with `&&`. Use semicolon `;` instead:
  `npm test; npm run build`

Vite 8 Rolldown Configuration Note:
  In `vite.config.ts`, `build.rollupOptions.output.manualChunks` must be a function:
  `manualChunks(id) { ... }` rather than an object map.

